<title>JAPAN: Katokichi to change rules for share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Katokichi to change rules for share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frozen food producer Katokichi Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it would change its company regulations so that it would be able to repurchase three million of its own shares.</p>
<p>The change will need approval at the company's shareholders' meeting on June 27, Katokichi said in a statement.</p>
</text>
